    "description": "Agentic model for professional knowledge work, post-trained from GLM-5.3 Flash. Text and image input with text output; the Responses API rejects images. Reasoning is required, with efforts low, high, and max, and the default is max. The output ceiling is 32,768 tokens including reasoning. The context window size is not stated. Standard price is $0.15 input, $0.03 cached input, and $0.50 output per million tokens; reasoning tokens are billed as output. The OpenAI SDK base URL is https://api.paperinstruments.com/v1. The Anthropic SDK base URL is https://api.paperinstruments.com.",
